{"audio": "1john-03.opus", "voice": "Davis", "duration_ms": 174000, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 2133, "text": "1 John, Chapter Three."}, {"start_ms": 2133, "end_ms": 11467, "text": "Behold, what manner of love the Father hath bestowed upon us, that we should be called the sons of God: therefore the world knoweth us not, because it knew him not."}, {"start_ms": 11467, "end_ms": 23067, "text": "Beloved, now are we the sons of God, and it doth not yet appear what we shall be: but we know that, when he shall appear, we shall be like him; for we shall see him as he is."}, {"start_ms": 23067, "end_ms": 28533, "text": "And every man that hath this hope in him purifieth himself, even as he is pure."}, {"start_ms": 28533, "end_ms": 34000, "text": "Whosoever committeth sin transgresseth also the law: for sin is the transgression of the law."}, {"start_ms": 34000, "end_ms": 39733, "text": "And ye know that he was manifested to take away our sins; and in him is no sin."}, {"start_ms": 39733, "end_ms": 45467, "text": "Whosoever abideth in him sinneth not: whosoever sinneth hath not seen him, neither known him."}, {"start_ms": 45467, "end_ms": 52267, "text": "Little children, let no man deceive you: he that doeth righteousness is righteous, even as he is righteous."}, {"start_ms": 52267, "end_ms": 57333, "text": "He that committeth sin is of the devil; for the devil sinneth from the beginning."}, {"start_ms": 57333, "end_ms": 62133, "text": "For this purpose the Son of God was manifested, that he might destroy the works of the devil."}, {"start_ms": 62133, "end_ms": 70933, "text": "Whosoever is born of God doth not commit sin; for his seed remaineth in him: and he cannot sin, because he is born of God."}, {"start_ms": 70933, "end_ms": 80533, "text": "In this the children of God are manifest, and the children of the devil: whosoever doeth not righteousness is not of God, neither he that loveth not his brother."}, {"start_ms": 80533, "end_ms": 85200, "text": "For this is the message that ye heard from the beginning, that we should love one another."}, {"start_ms": 85200, "end_ms": 88533, "text": "Not as Cain, who was of that wicked one, and slew his brother."}, {"start_ms": 88533, "end_ms": 90000, "text": "And wherefore slew he him?"}, {"start_ms": 90000, "end_ms": 93867, "text": "Because his own works were evil, and his brother's righteous."}, {"start_ms": 93867, "end_ms": 96800, "text": "Marvel not, my brethren, if the world hate you."}, {"start_ms": 96800, "end_ms": 102000, "text": "We know that we have passed from death unto life, because we love the brethren."}, {"start_ms": 102000, "end_ms": 104800, "text": "He that loveth not his brother abideth in death."}, {"start_ms": 104800, "end_ms": 110933, "text": "Whosoever hateth his brother is a murderer: and ye know that no murderer hath eternal life abiding in him."}, {"start_ms": 110933, "end_ms": 118533, "text": "Hereby perceive we the love of God, because he laid down his life for us: and we ought to lay down our lives for the brethren."}, {"start_ms": 118533, "end_ms": 128267, "text": "But whoso hath this world's good, and seeth his brother have need, and shutteth up his bowels of compassion from him, how dwelleth the love of God in him?"}, {"start_ms": 128267, "end_ms": 134000, "text": "My little children, let us not love in word, neither in tongue; but in deed and in truth."}, {"start_ms": 134000, "end_ms": 139200, "text": "And hereby we know that we are of the truth, and shall assure our hearts before him."}, {"start_ms": 139200, "end_ms": 144667, "text": "For if our heart condemn us, God is greater than our heart, and knoweth all things."}, {"start_ms": 144667, "end_ms": 149200, "text": "Beloved, if our heart condemn us not, then have we confidence toward God."}, {"start_ms": 149200, "end_ms": 156267, "text": "And whatsoever we ask, we receive of him, because we keep his commandments, and do those things that are pleasing in his sight."}, {"start_ms": 156267, "end_ms": 163867, "text": "And this is his commandment, That we should believe on the name of his Son Jesus Christ, and love one another, as he gave us commandment."}, {"start_ms": 163867, "end_ms": 169200, "text": "And he that keepeth his commandments dwelleth in him, and he in him."}, {"start_ms": 169200, "end_ms": 174000, "text": "And hereby we know that he abideth in us, by the Spirit which he hath given us."}], "words": [{"t": "1", "s": 0, "e": 684, "si": 0}, {"t": "John,", "s": 684, "e": 1046, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 1348, "e": 1710, "si": 0}, {"t": "Three.", "s": 1771, "e": 2032, "si": 0}, {"t": "Behold,", "s": 2413, "e": 2894, "si": 1}, {"t": "what", "s": 2974, "e": 3114, "si": 1}, {"t": "manner", "s": 3155, "e": 3415, "si": 1}, {"t": "of", "s": 3455, "e": 3555, "si": 1}, {"t": "love", "s": 3635, "e": 3896, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 3936, "e": 4016, "si": 1}, {"t": "Father", "s": 4076, "e": 4416, "si": 1}, {"t": "hath", "s": 4477, "e": 4657, "si": 1}, {"t": "bestowed", "s": 4697, "e": 5117, "si": 1}, {"t": "upon", "s": 5158, "e": 5438, "si": 1}, {"t": "us,", "s": 5498, "e": 5658, "si": 1}, {"t": "that", "s": 6099, "e": 6219, "si": 1}, {"t": "we", "s": 6259, "e": 6319, "si": 1}, {"t": "should", "s": 6379, "e": 6540, "si": 1}, {"t": "be", "s": 6560, "e": 6600, "si": 1}, {"t": "called", "s": 6680, "e": 7040, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 7060, "e": 7141, "si": 1}, {"t": "sons", "s": 7221, "e": 7481, "si": 1}, {"t": "of", "s": 7501, "e": 7581, "si": 1}, {"t": "God:", "s": 7641, "e": 8022, "si": 1}, {"t": "therefore", "s": 8703, "e": 9083, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 9103, "e": 9184, "si": 1}, {"t": "world", "s": 9204, "e": 9464, "si": 1}, {"t": "knoweth", "s": 9484, "e": 9764, "si": 1}, {"t": "us", "s": 9784, "e": 9905, "si": 1}, {"t": "not,", "s": 9985, "e": 10245, "si": 1}, {"t": "because", "s": 10305, "e": 10586, "si": 1}, {"t": "it", "s": 10606, "e": 10686, "si": 1}, {"t": "knew", "s": 10746, "e": 10906, "si": 1}, {"t": "him", "s": 10966, "e": 11086, "si": 1}, 